# SoundMat：开机时等系统时钟校准，再启动声音（JACK → 合成器服务 → 主机程序）；之后这次开机不再校时。
# 见 soundmat-clock 脚本开头的说明和 docs/implementation/DEPLOYMENT.md「时钟」。
[Unit]
Description=SoundMat: wait for the clock to be set before starting sound, then stop time sync
After=systemd-timesyncd.service NetworkManager.service
Wants=systemd-timesyncd.service
Before=jackd.service

[Service]
Type=oneshot
RemainAfterExit=yes
ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/soundmat-clock
TimeoutStartSec=90

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
